# Root-Me - TCP Chaîne encodée

## Challenge

This challenge requires connecting to a TCP server and decoding an encoded string received from the server.

A valid response must be sent within a limited time after receiving the encoded data.

## Objective

Automate the decoding process using Python and send the decoded message back to the server.

